## 16. Termination

Rights granted to a party under this License automatically terminate while that party materially violates this License.

After termination, that party must stop activities that require permission under this License, including non-compliant distribution.

Downstream users who independently comply with this License do not automatically lose their rights solely because an upstream distributor violated it.

Rights may be restored after the violation is corrected where the Project Steward and applicable project governance permit restoration.

